            <note corresp="#d6-f3" n="21" xml:id="d6-f3-content">
                <p>For Dr. Stuart’s own account of his “supposed connection with Japanese peace
                    efforts”, see John Leighton Stuart, <hi rendition="#italic">Fifty Years in
